{"book":"leviticus","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:34:07.127027448Z","verse":23,"ref":"leviticus 18:23","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":18,"translation":"And with any beast you shall not give your lying ⟨for⟩ uncleanness with it; and a woman shall not stand before a beast to lie with it — it ⟨is⟩ a perversion.","tokens":[{"surface":"ובכל","gloss":"and with any"},{"surface":"בהמה","gloss":"beast"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תתן","gloss":"you shall give"},{"surface":"שכבתך","gloss":"your lying"},{"surface":"לטמאה","gloss":"for uncleanness"},{"surface":"בה","gloss":"with it"},{"surface":"ואשה","gloss":"and a woman"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"תעמד","gloss":"shall stand"},{"surface":"לפני","gloss":"before"},{"surface":"בהמה","gloss":"a beast"},{"surface":"לרבעה","gloss":"to lie with it"},{"surface":"תבל","gloss":"a perversion"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"it"}]}